olor\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$1,250</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plays music</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.60.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 28th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>“Choo Choo! We're on a western mission!”</big></i></p></blockquote>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Oak Rails</b> is a vinyl created by The_OvertimeGamer, it can be purchased for <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$1,250</span> at <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a>.  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Song\">Song</span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4f/Oak_Rails_Vinyl_Sound.mp3/revision/latest?cb=20240704065909\" width=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 300px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:Oak_Rails_Vinyl_Sound.mp3\">https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:Oak_Rails_Vinyl_Sound.mp3</a></audio></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Location\"><big>Location</big></span></h2><p>\nThe vinyl is hidden in the rafters of <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a>.</p><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 351px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/87/1582541544_9938675423_1720886102179.png/revision/latest?cb=20240713160253\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"sun rails location\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/87/1582541544_9938675423_1720886102179.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/351?cb=20240713160253\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"351\" height=\"181\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"1582541544 9938675423 1720886102179.png\" data-image-key=\"1582541544_9938675423_1720886102179.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:1582541544_9938675423_1720886102179.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">sun rails location</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is third the most expensive vinyl ingame.<br /></li></ul>\n<